  {
   "screen": "Writer's purpose, audience and tone",
   "title": "Figure 4.2 · Anatomy of a complete purpose statement",
   "alt": "The purpose statement \"The writer's purpose is to warn Caribbean parents that excessive screen time is eroding family communication and to encourage them to create device-free family time\" is split into labelled blocks: \"warn\" is the verb for the primary purpose, \"Caribbean parents\" is the audience, \"that excessive screen time is eroding family communication\" is the message, \"encourage\" is the verb for the secondary purpose, \"them\" is the audience again and \"to create device-free family time\" is the message. A crossed-out weak version reads \"The purpose is to inform.\" Four groups of precise verbs follow: giving information (inform, explain, highlight); changing minds or behaviour (persuade, warn, criticize); motivating or analysing (encourage, examine, compare); teaching or delighting (educate, entertain).",
   "caption": "A complete purpose statement names a precise verb, the audience and the message. This one has a primary and a secondary purpose.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 392\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"198.6\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"105.3\" y=\"28\">The writer’s purpose is to</text><rect x=\"259.8\" y=\"6\" width=\"59.3\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"289.5\" y=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">warn</text><text x=\"289.5\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">verb: primary purpose</text><rect x=\"374.3\" y=\"6\" width=\"149.5\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"449\" y=\"28\">Caribbean parents</text><text x=\"449\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">audience</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"72\" width=\"441.7\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"226.8\" y=\"94\">that excessive screen time is eroding family communication</text><text x=\"226.8\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">message</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"138\" width=\"64.8\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"38.4\" y=\"160\">and to</text><rect x=\"101.8\" y=\"138\" width=\"103.2\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"153.4\" y=\"160\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">encourage</text><text x=\"153.4\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">verb: second purpose</text><rect x=\"239.4\" y=\"138\" width=\"56.6\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"267.7\" y=\"160\">them</text><text x=\"267.7\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">audience</text><rect x=\"309.4\" y=\"138\" width=\"254.2\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"436.5\" y=\"160\">to create device-free family time.</text><text x=\"436.5\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">message</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"206\" width=\"628\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"228\" font-size=\"13\">Weak: “The purpose is to inform.” Inform whom, about what?</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Precise purpose verbs</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"278\" width=\"150\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"81\" y=\"308.5\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"81\">Giving</tspan><tspan x=\"81\" dy=\"16.6\">information</tspan></text><text x=\"81\" y=\"343.1\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"81\">inform, explain,</tspan><tspan x=\"81\" dy=\"16.6\">highlight</tspan></text><rect x=\"164\" y=\"278\" width=\"150\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"239\" y=\"308.5\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"239\">Changing minds</tspan><tspan x=\"239\" dy=\"16.6\">or behaviour</tspan></text><text x=\"239\" y=\"343.1\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"239\">persuade, warn,</tspan><tspan x=\"239\" dy=\"16.6\">criticize</tspan></text><rect x=\"322\" y=\"278\" width=\"150\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"397\" y=\"308.5\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"397\">Motivating or</tspan><tspan x=\"397\" dy=\"16.6\">analysing</tspan></text><text x=\"397\" y=\"343.1\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"397\">encourage,</tspan><tspan x=\"397\" dy=\"16.6\">examine, compare</tspan></text><rect x=\"480\" y=\"278\" width=\"150\" height=\"106\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"555\" y=\"316.8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"555\">Teaching or</tspan><tspan x=\"555\" dy=\"16.6\">delighting</tspan></text><text x=\"555\" y=\"351.4\" font-size=\"13\">educate, entertain</text></g></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Reading strategies: skim, scan, SQ3R",
   "title": "Figure 4.3 · Skimming, scanning and SQ3R",
   "alt": "Two page sketches. Skimming: a dashed path runs through the title, the first line of each paragraph and the last paragraph, reading quickly for the general idea. Scanning: an arrow drops straight to one highlighted item, \"9 a.m.\", searching quickly for specific information such as a date, a name or a figure. Below, the five SQ3R steps in order: Survey (skim headings), Question (turn headings into questions), Read (to answer them), Recite (say the answers in your own words) and Review (go over it again later).",
   "caption": "Skim first for the gist, scan to find evidence, and use SQ3R to study your own notes.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 376\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M1U4-3-g\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"308\" height=\"214\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">Skimming</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"44\" width=\"130\" height=\"162\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"42\" y=\"54\" width=\"80\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-muted\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"76\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"88\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"100\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"120\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"132\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"144\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"144\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"148\" y2=\"164\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"176\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"42\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"188\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M36 58H128L38 76H148L38 120H148L38 164H148\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"244\" y=\"116.4\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"244\">Reading quickly for</tspan><tspan x=\"244\" dy=\"16.6\">the general idea</tspan></text><rect x=\"326\" y=\"6\" width=\"308\" height=\"214\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">Scanning</text><rect x=\"350\" y=\"44\" width=\"130\" height=\"162\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f-softb s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"362\" y=\"54\" width=\"80\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-muted\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"468\" y2=\"76\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"454\" y2=\"88\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"100\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"468\" y2=\"120\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"454\" y2=\"132\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"144\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"144\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"468\" y2=\"164\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"454\" y2=\"176\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"362\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"188\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"414\" y=\"136\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"440\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">9 a.m.</text><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"132\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-g)\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"564\">Searching quickly</tspan><tspan x=\"564\" dy=\"16.6\">for one specific</tspan><tspan x=\"564\" dy=\"16.6\">detail</tspan></text><text x=\"6\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">SQ3R: a study method</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"262\" width=\"116\" height=\"108\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"64\" y=\"302\" font-weight=\"700\">Survey</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"320.3\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"64\">Skim the</tspan><tspan x=\"64\" dy=\"16.6\">headings</tspan></text><line x1=\"122\" y1=\"316\" x2=\"131\" y2=\"316\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-g)\"/><rect x=\"133\" y=\"262\" width=\"116\" height=\"108\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"191\" y=\"302\" font-weight=\"700\">Question</text><text x=\"191\" y=\"320.3\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"191\">Turn headings</tspan><tspan x=\"191\" dy=\"16.6\">into questions</tspan></text><line x1=\"249\" y1=\"316\" x2=\"258\" y2=\"316\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-g)\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"262\" width=\"116\" height=\"108\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"302\" font-weight=\"700\">Read</text><text x=\"318\" y=\"320.3\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"318\">Read to</tspan><tspan x=\"318\" dy=\"16.6\">answer them</tspan></text><line x1=\"376\" y1=\"316\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"316\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-g)\"/><rect x=\"387\" y=\"262\" width=\"116\" height=\"108\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"445\" y=\"285.4\" font-weight=\"700\">Recite</text><text x=\"445\" y=\"303.7\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"445\">Say the</tspan><tspan x=\"445\" dy=\"16.6\">answers in</tspan><tspan x=\"445\" dy=\"16.6\">your own</tspan><tspan x=\"445\" dy=\"16.6\">words</tspan></text><line x1=\"503\" y1=\"316\" x2=\"512\" y2=\"316\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M1U4-3-g)\"/><rect x=\"514\" y=\"262\" width=\"116\" height=\"108\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"572\" y=\"302\" font-weight=\"700\">Review</text><text x=\"572\" y=\"320.3\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"572\">Go over it</tspan><tspan x=\"572\" dy=\"16.6\">again later</tspan></text></g></svg>"
  }
