  {
   "screen": "Advantages and limitations of each medium",
   "title": "Figure 8.2 · Weighing traditional and new media",
   "alt": "Two columns. Traditional media advantages: credibility, depth, permanence, reach and accessibility; limitations: cost and time, one-way flow, space constraints and owner bias. New and social media advantages: speed, accessibility (anyone can publish), interaction, multimedia and low cost; limitations: misinformation, unknown credibility, echo chambers, posts that are edited or deleted, data exploitation and effects on mental health.",
   "caption": "Neither medium is automatically better. Weigh the strengths and limits of the specific medium a source comes from.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 444\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"312\" height=\"34\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"24.6\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">Traditional media</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"46\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Credibility</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">editing and fact-checking</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"80\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Depth</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">room for full arguments</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"114\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Permanence</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">printed or archived</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"148\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Reach</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">thousands at the same moment</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"182\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Accessibility</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">older and rural readers</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"224\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost and time</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">news is delayed</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"258\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">One-way</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">readers cannot reply at once</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"292\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"312\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"312\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Space</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"312\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">fixed pages; stories cut</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"326\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"346\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"346\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Bias</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"346\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">owner’s politics or profits</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"4\" width=\"312\" height=\"34\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"24.6\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">New and social media</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"46\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Speed</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">news in seconds</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"80\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Accessibility</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">anyone can publish</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"114\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Interaction</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">comments, shares, replies</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"148\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Multimedia</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">text, image, video, audio</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"182\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softok\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">+</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Cost</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">free or low-cost</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"224\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Misinformation</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">no editor checks facts</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"258\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Credibility unknown</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">who wrote it?</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"292\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"312\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"312\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Echo chambers</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"312\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">algorithms narrow views</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"326\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"346\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"346\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Permanence problem</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"346\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">edited or deleted</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"360\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Exploitation</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">personal data harvested</text><rect x=\"324\" y=\"394\" width=\"312\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softbad\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"414\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\">–</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"414\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Mental health</text><text x=\"628\" y=\"414\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\">comparison, cyberbullying</text></g></svg>"
  }
