   "screen": "Writing the Module 2 essay",
   "title": "Figure 8.2 · Turning the question bullets into paragraphs",
   "alt": "Left: a question card with three bullet tasks, such as giving a reason for a speaker's use of two varieties, identifying a grammatical and a phonological feature, and explaining a challenge a Creole speaker faces in learning Standard English. Right: the essay. The introduction runs context, main point, purpose, thesis. Arrows link bullet 1 to body paragraph 1, bullet 2 to body paragraph 2 and bullet 3 to body paragraph 3, each a PEEL paragraph in the same order. A conclusion, shorter than the introduction, closes the essay. A bar shows the marks: Content 10, Organization 7, Expression 8, out of 25, in no more than 500 words.",
   "caption": "Answer every bullet, in order: one PEEL paragraph per bullet, following the order of your thesis.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 372\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"M2U6-2-g\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"236\" height=\"290\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"122\" y=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\">The question asks you to...</text><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"74\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"78.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">1</text><rect x=\"44\" y=\"44\" width=\"186\" height=\"64\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"62.5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"52\">give a reason for a</tspan><tspan x=\"52\" dy=\"16.6\">speaker’s use of two</tspan><tspan x=\"52\" dy=\"16.6\">varieties</tspan></text><path d=\"M230 76 L300 76 L300 132 L328 132\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U6-2-g)\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"156\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"160.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">2</text><rect x=\"44\" y=\"126\" width=\"186\" height=\"64\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"144.5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"52\">identify a grammatical</tspan><tspan x=\"52\" dy=\"16.6\">and a phonological</tspan><tspan x=\"52\" dy=\"16.6\">feature</tspan></text><path d=\"M230 158 L300 158 L300 186 L328 186\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U6-2-g)\"/><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"238\" r=\"12\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"26\" y=\"242.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">3</text><rect x=\"44\" y=\"208\" width=\"186\" height=\"64\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"234.8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"52\">explain a challenge in</tspan><tspan x=\"52\" dy=\"16.6\">learning Standard English</tspan></text><path d=\"M230 240 L300 240 L300 240 L328 240\" class=\"f-none s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#M2U6-2-g)\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"4\" width=\"306\" height=\"96\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-soft s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"483\" y=\"47.4\" font-weight=\"700\">Introduction</text><text x=\"483\" y=\"63.6\" font-size=\"13\">context → main point → purpose → thesis</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"112\" width=\"306\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"483\" y=\"137.4\">Body 1 · PEEL on bullet 1</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"166\" width=\"306\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"483\" y=\"191.4\">Body 2 · PEEL on bullet 2</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"220\" width=\"306\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"483\" y=\"245.4\">Body 3 · PEEL on bullet 3</text><rect x=\"380\" y=\"274\" width=\"206\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"483\" y=\"299.4\">Conclusion (shorter)</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">25 marks · no more than 500 words</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"346\" width=\"248.8\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"128.4\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">Content 10</text><rect x=\"256.8\" y=\"346\" width=\"173\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"343.3\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Organization 7</text><rect x=\"433.8\" y=\"346\" width=\"198.2\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"532.9\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Expression 8</text></g></svg>"
