   "screen": "Communicating through technology",
   "title": "Figure 7.3 · Anatomy of a formal email",
   "alt": "A mock email with numbered callouts. 1, a professional address based on your name. 2, a clear subject line, \"Request: extension for research report\". 3, a formal salutation, \"Dear Ms. Hodge,\". 4, short paragraphs with one main purpose. 5, no textspeak or emojis. 6, a formal close and full name, \"Kind regards, Keisha James, Form 6\". 7, check attachments and recipients, Reply or Reply All, and proofread before sending.",
   "caption": "A formal email keeps the conventions of a letter: professional address, clear subject, salutation, short paragraphs, formal close. Proofread before you press Send.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 424\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"340\" height=\"412\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"340\" height=\"30\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">New message</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">From:</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">keisha.james@ (school address)</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">To:</text><text x=\"68\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">Ms. Hodge</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">Subject:</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Request: extension for research report</text><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"140\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">Dear Ms. Hodge,</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"186\" x2=\"294\" y2=\"186\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"294\" y2=\"200\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"214\" x2=\"224\" y2=\"214\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"252\" x2=\"294\" y2=\"252\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"224\" y2=\"266\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"316\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">Kind regards,</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"336\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Keisha James</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"354\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">Form 6</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"372\" width=\"90\" height=\"30\" rx=\"15\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"61\" y=\"391.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">Send</text><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"56\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"60.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">1</text><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"122\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"126.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">2</text><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"162\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"166.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">3</text><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"208\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"212.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">4</text><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"262\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"266.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">5</text><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"334\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"338.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">6</text><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"387\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"391.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">7</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"6\" width=\"280\" height=\"46.9\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"29.4\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"374\" y=\"34.1\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">1</text><text x=\"394\" y=\"26.2\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"394\">Professional address based on your</tspan><tspan x=\"394\" dy=\"15.9\">name</tspan></text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"61.9\" width=\"280\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"83.9\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"374\" y=\"88.5\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">2</text><text x=\"394\" y=\"88.5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">Clear subject line</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"114.9\" width=\"280\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"136.9\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"374\" y=\"141.5\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">3</text><text x=\"394\" y=\"141.5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">Formal salutation</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"167.9\" width=\"280\" height=\"46.9\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"191.3\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"374\" y=\"196\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">4</text><text x=\"394\" y=\"188\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"394\">Short paragraphs; one main</tspan><tspan x=\"394\" dy=\"15.9\">purpose</tspan></text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"223.7\" width=\"280\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"245.7\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"374\" y=\"250.4\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">5</text><text x=\"394\" y=\"250.4\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">No textspeak or emojis</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"276.7\" width=\"280\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"298.7\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"374\" y=\"303.4\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">6</text><text x=\"394\" y=\"303.4\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">Formal close, full name and role</text><rect x=\"356\" y=\"329.7\" width=\"280\" height=\"46.9\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"353.2\" r=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"374\" y=\"357.8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">7</text><text x=\"394\" y=\"349.9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"394\">Check attachments and recipients</tspan><tspan x=\"394\" dy=\"15.9\">(Reply vs Reply All); proofread</tspan></text></g></svg>"
