  {
   "screen": "Q1(b): justifying media",
   "title": "Figure 2.2 · Which media can you justify?",
   "alt": "Three key words from the question: justify means give reasons, not just names; traditional means not social media; other than print means no newspaper or flyer. Six traditional media you can justify, each with a reason: radio, cheap, reaches every district and is repeated many times a day; television, sight and sound together, for example showing how to fit hurricane straps; film, shown many times at community centres; telephone, short direct messages but costly for large audiences; word of mouth, suits people who prefer orature and is fast, but messages can be distorted; mobile loudspeaker, reaches people where they are. Ruled out: newspaper and flyer, because they are print; social media and websites, because they are not traditional. Marks: each medium clearly justified earns 2; two media named without explanation earn 1.",
   "caption": "Every word in the question rules something in or out. Then tie each reason to this target group and this message.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 374\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"204\" height=\"54\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"12\" width=\"70.2\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"49.1\" y=\"27.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">justify</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">give reasons, not just names</text><rect x=\"218\" y=\"4\" width=\"204\" height=\"54\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"228\" y=\"12\" width=\"101.2\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"278.6\" y=\"27.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">traditional</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">not social media</text><rect x=\"432\" y=\"4\" width=\"204\" height=\"54\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"442\" y=\"12\" width=\"141.8\" height=\"22\" rx=\"11\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"512.9\" y=\"27.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">other than print</text><text x=\"444\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">no newspaper or flyer</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Traditional media you can justify</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"92\" width=\"204\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"107.7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Radio</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"124\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"14\">cheap; reaches every</tspan><tspan x=\"14\" dy=\"16.6\">district; repeated many</tspan><tspan x=\"14\" dy=\"16.6\">times a day</tspan></text><rect x=\"218\" y=\"92\" width=\"204\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Television</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"132.3\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"228\">sight and sound together,</tspan><tspan x=\"228\" dy=\"16.6\">e.g. how to fit straps</tspan></text><rect x=\"432\" y=\"92\" width=\"204\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"442\" y=\"116\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Film</text><text x=\"442\" y=\"132.3\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"442\">shown many times at</tspan><tspan x=\"442\" dy=\"16.6\">community centres</tspan></text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"174\" width=\"204\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Telephone</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"214.3\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"14\">short direct messages;</tspan><tspan x=\"14\" dy=\"16.6\">costly for large audiences</tspan></text><rect x=\"218\" y=\"174\" width=\"204\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Word of mouth</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"214.3\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"228\">suits orature; fast, but can</tspan><tspan x=\"228\" dy=\"16.6\">be distorted</tspan></text><rect x=\"432\" y=\"174\" width=\"204\" height=\"74\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"442\" y=\"198\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Mobile loudspeaker</text><text x=\"442\" y=\"214.3\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"442\">a van reaches people where</tspan><tspan x=\"442\" dy=\"16.6\">they are</tspan></text><text x=\"4\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Ruled out</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"280\" width=\"204.3\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"14.5\" y1=\"289.5\" x2=\"23.5\" y2=\"298.5\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"14.5\" y1=\"298.5\" x2=\"23.5\" y2=\"289.5\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"299\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">newspaper, flyer</tspan><tspan class=\"f-muted\"> · print</tspan></text><rect x=\"216.3\" y=\"280\" width=\"310.6\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"226.8\" y1=\"289.5\" x2=\"235.8\" y2=\"298.5\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"226.8\" y1=\"298.5\" x2=\"235.8\" y2=\"289.5\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"244.3\" y=\"299\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\">social media, websites</tspan><tspan class=\"f-muted\"> · not traditional</tspan></text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"322\" width=\"380\" height=\"46\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"194\" y=\"350\" font-weight=\"700\">Each medium clearly justified: 2 marks</text><rect x=\"392\" y=\"322\" width=\"244\" height=\"46\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"514\" y=\"341.9\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\"><tspan x=\"514\">Two named, no explanation:</tspan><tspan x=\"514\" dy=\"15.6\">1 mark only</tspan></text></g></svg>"
  },
  {
   "screen": "Q1(c): commenting on a local source of information",
   "title": "Figure 2.3 · Turning a named source into 2 marks",
   "alt": "Top: the three Module 1 tests for a source. Credibility and authority: is the person qualified or officially responsible? Currency and relevance: do they have up-to-date information about this programme, in this community? Reliability: is their information accurate and consistent with official sources? Middle: two answers. Identified only, \"Parents could consult the nurse\", earns 1 mark. Explained, earning 2 marks: \"Parents could consult the nurse at their local community health clinic. She is trained, works directly with the Ministry's screening programme, and can answer questions about safety face to face in language parents understand\", with the evidence labelled as training, role and access to official information, and suits this audience. Bottom: good local sources include health care workers, teachers, religious leaders, Justices of the Peace, political representatives, official government websites where internet access is available, and testimonials from people who have already done it. A rumour on a group chat fails the reliability test.",
   "caption": "Name the source, then use the Module 1 tests to say why parents or homeowners can trust it. The evidence is the source's training, role and access to official information.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 438\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"204\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\">Credibility &amp; authority</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"45.3\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"106\">Qualified or officially</tspan><tspan x=\"106\" dy=\"16.6\">responsible?</tspan></text><rect x=\"218\" y=\"4\" width=\"204\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"20.7\" font-weight=\"700\">Currency &amp; relevance</text><text x=\"320\" y=\"37\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"320\">Up to date on this</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"16.6\">programme, in this</tspan><tspan x=\"320\" dy=\"16.6\">community?</tspan></text><rect x=\"432\" y=\"4\" width=\"204\" height=\"76\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"534\" y=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\">Reliability</text><text x=\"534\" y=\"45.3\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"534\">Accurate and consistent</tspan><tspan x=\"534\" dy=\"16.6\">with official sources?</tspan></text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"88\" width=\"632\" height=\"40\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Identified only:</text><text x=\"134\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\">“Parents could consult the nurse.”</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"96\" width=\"86\" height=\"24\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-bad\"/><text x=\"583\" y=\"112.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">1 mark</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"138\" width=\"632\" height=\"178.4\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"160\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Explained:</text><rect x=\"540\" y=\"144\" width=\"86\" height=\"24\" rx=\"12\" class=\"f-ok\"/><text x=\"583\" y=\"160.7\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">2 marks</text><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"172\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"201.1\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\"><tspan x=\"28\">“Parents could consult the nurse at their local community</tspan><tspan x=\"28\" dy=\"16.1\">health clinic.</tspan></text><text x=\"626\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">the source</text><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"209.1\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"222.1\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"219.1\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\">She is trained,</text><text x=\"626\" y=\"219.1\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">training</text><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"230.1\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"259.2\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"240.1\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\">works directly with the Ministry’s screening programme,</text><text x=\"626\" y=\"240.1\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\"><tspan x=\"626\">role; access to official</tspan><tspan x=\"626\" dy=\"16.1\">information</tspan></text><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"267.2\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"296.4\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"277.2\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\"><tspan x=\"28\">and can answer questions about safety face to face in</tspan><tspan x=\"28\" dy=\"16.1\">language parents understand.”</tspan></text><text x=\"626\" y=\"277.2\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">suits this audience</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"326.4\" width=\"632\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"346.4\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"16\">Good local sources: health care workers, teachers, religious leaders, Justices of the Peace,</tspan><tspan x=\"16\" dy=\"16.4\">political representatives, official government websites (where internet access is available),</tspan><tspan x=\"16\" dy=\"16.4\">and testimonials from people who have already done it.</tspan></text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"402.4\" width=\"632\" height=\"30\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"15.5\" y1=\"412.9\" x2=\"24.5\" y2=\"421.9\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"15.5\" y1=\"421.9\" x2=\"24.5\" y2=\"412.9\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"422.4\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">A rumour on a group chat fails the reliability test.</text></g></svg>"
  }
