   "screen": "The justification: 15 marks in 50–100 words",
   "title": "Figure 5.1 · Building a 15-mark justification",
   "alt": "Top: two bars drawn to scale show that the justification, Question 3(b), is worth 15 marks, more than all of Question 1, worth 10. Middle: the reliable template in three colour-coded parts, each worth 5 marks. Purpose: \"The purpose of this [form] is to [precise verb] [audience] to [action].\" Audience: \"The intended audience is [specific group], who [relevant detail].\" Context: \"The context of communication is [real-world place and occasion], so I used [register or language choice] and [technique or appeal] to [effect on this audience].\" Bottom: vague versus specific. Audience: \"everyone\" is too vague; \"homeowners over sixty in hillside districts\" is specific. Context: \"about hurricanes\" is content, not context; \"the home section of a weekend newspaper in May\" is context. A footer: 50 to 100 words, Standard English always, and draft it straight after planning, before the piece.",
   "caption": "Naming purpose, audience and context is not enough: the top band connects each one to your piece. Draft the justification right after planning so it can never be left out.",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 640 430\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\"><defs><marker id=\"P3U5-1-g\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"10\" markerHeight=\"10\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"f-gold\"/></marker></defs><g font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"170\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Q3(b) justification</text><rect x=\"178\" y=\"8\" width=\"390\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"373\" y=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">15 marks</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">all of Question 1</text><rect x=\"178\" y=\"42\" width=\"260\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-softb s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"61\" font-weight=\"700\">10 marks</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"84\" width=\"632\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"84\" width=\"112\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-gold\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"107\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">Purpose</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-ongold\">5 marks</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"113.7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">The purpose of this [form] is to [precise verb] [audience] to [action].</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"142\" width=\"632\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"142\" width=\"112\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"165\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">Audience</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-ongold\">5 marks</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"171.7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">The intended audience is [specific group], who [relevant detail].</text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"200\" width=\"632\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"200\" width=\"112\" height=\"70\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"233\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-ongold\">Context</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-ongold\">5 marks</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"223.3\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"128\">The context of communication is [real-world place and occasion], so I used</tspan><tspan x=\"128\" dy=\"16.4\">[register/language choice] and [technique or appeal] to [effect on this</tspan><tspan x=\"128\" dy=\"16.4\">audience].</tspan></text><text x=\"4\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"700\">Specific, not vague</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">Audience</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"300\" width=\"196\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"91.5\" y1=\"314.5\" x2=\"100.5\" y2=\"323.5\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"91.5\" y1=\"323.5\" x2=\"100.5\" y2=\"314.5\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"323.7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">“everyone”</text><line x1=\"278\" y1=\"319\" x2=\"294\" y2=\"319\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#P3U5-1-g)\"/><rect x=\"298\" y=\"300\" width=\"338\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M309 319L312.3 322.5L319 315.2\" class=\"f-none s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"328\" y=\"323.7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\">“homeowners over sixty in hillside districts”</text><text x=\"4\" y=\"371\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"f-muted\">Context</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"346\" width=\"196\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softbad s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"91.5\" y1=\"360.5\" x2=\"100.5\" y2=\"369.5\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"91.5\" y1=\"369.5\" x2=\"100.5\" y2=\"360.5\" class=\"s-bad\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"110\" y=\"361.9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"110\">“about hurricanes” (that</tspan><tspan x=\"110\" dy=\"15.6\">is content)</tspan></text><line x1=\"278\" y1=\"365\" x2=\"294\" y2=\"365\" class=\"s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#P3U5-1-g)\"/><rect x=\"298\" y=\"346\" width=\"338\" height=\"38\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-softok s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M309 365L312.3 368.5L319 361.2\" class=\"f-none s-ok\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"328\" y=\"361.9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-size=\"13\"><tspan x=\"328\">“the home section of a weekend newspaper</tspan><tspan x=\"328\" dy=\"15.6\">in May”</tspan></text><rect x=\"4\" y=\"396\" width=\"632\" height=\"30\" rx=\"10\" class=\"f-surface s-gold\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"414.1\" font-size=\"13\">50–100 words · Standard English, always · draft it straight after planning, before the piece</text></g></svg>"
